WEBVTT

00:09.710 --> 00:11.590
We're finally here.

00:11.590 --> 00:14.130
It's the hidden dungeon
that Jasper told us about.

00:15.140 --> 00:17.600
I hope we can find Yuri's family here.

00:20.600 --> 00:22.430
Don't worry.

00:22.430 --> 00:24.270
I'll make sure that you meet them.

00:25.650 --> 00:26.560
Okay!

00:29.150 --> 00:34.110
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

00:34.110 --> 00:38.910
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle♪

00:38.910 --> 00:48.710
(Even Given the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,
I'm Actually the Strongest)

00:48.710 --> 00:53.470
♪A fleeting dream I had is falling now♪

00:53.470 --> 00:57.340
♪The loneliness remains as my power♪

00:58.720 --> 01:02.640
♪To a life that is drifting away♪

01:02.640 --> 01:05.850
♪The magic sprinkles upon♪

01:07.270 --> 01:12.030
♪I pick up the fragments
and tightly tether them♪

01:12.030 --> 01:16.700
♪I always keep them as
my source of strength in my heart♪

01:16.700 --> 01:18.950
♪See the world through my eyes♪

01:18.950 --> 01:21.290
♪And you'll get your treasure♪

01:21.290 --> 01:26.790
♪Let's go around the world and find it out♪

01:28.000 --> 01:32.380
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

01:32.840 --> 01:37.510
♪Everything's possible
I've overcome a lot so far♪

01:37.510 --> 01:42.390
♪Because you have given it to me♪

01:42.390 --> 01:49.190
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle, for good♪

02:05.160 --> 02:07.080
Huh? Is this a dead-end?

02:08.290 --> 02:12.380
Hmm. Looks like a teleportation spell
has been planted on the wall.

02:12.380 --> 02:15.130
You should be able to enter
the dungeon by touching it.

02:15.130 --> 02:17.170
I see. Like this?

02:20.050 --> 02:20.920
What?

02:21.860 --> 02:24.850
A jungle... in a dungeon?

02:24.850 --> 02:29.560
It seems that a powerful illusion
has altered the internal structure.

02:29.560 --> 02:32.020
An illusion?!

02:32.020 --> 02:34.780
To be able to do something so incredible.
Could this be...

02:34.780 --> 02:37.150
Hiya there, Big Sis Yuri!

02:37.150 --> 02:38.650
It's been so long!

02:39.130 --> 02:40.360
Pina!

02:40.860 --> 02:41.780
Pina?

02:41.780 --> 02:43.620
She's my little sister!

02:43.620 --> 02:45.540
The mischievous, cute one!

02:46.380 --> 02:49.920
I see that you've teamed up
with humans now.

02:50.750 --> 02:52.920
Pina, where are you?

02:54.250 --> 02:58.670
I'll be waiting in the back,
so don't get lost and come find me, okay?

02:58.670 --> 03:00.430
Well then, good luck!

03:00.430 --> 03:01.720
Pina!

03:01.720 --> 03:05.390
Now, wait a minute.
Yuri came all the way here to see you.

03:05.390 --> 03:07.680
- Can't you teleport us with...
- Sorry.

03:07.680 --> 03:10.730
I can't use that one.

03:10.730 --> 03:13.310
So, you'll have to walk all the way here.

03:13.310 --> 03:15.320
R-Really...

03:17.070 --> 03:21.070
That reminds me, teleportation magic
is an incredibly advanced spell.

03:21.450 --> 03:24.200
I've never seen anyone else use it
except Ursula.

03:24.200 --> 03:25.910
Ah, one thing, though.

03:26.830 --> 03:30.250
This dungeon I created is
not only full of traps,

03:30.250 --> 03:33.420
but also full of monsters.

03:33.420 --> 03:37.710
So I can't guarantee
you'll make it here safely.

03:37.710 --> 03:40.470
Got it! I'll give it my all!

03:40.470 --> 03:43.340
Your boyfriend there
will give it his all, all right.

03:43.340 --> 03:49.100
Th-That's not true.
Ein is not my boyfriend.

03:49.100 --> 03:51.980
All right, let's quickly get through this.

03:51.980 --> 03:54.320
It'll be dangerous,
so stay inside my eye.

03:54.320 --> 03:55.130
Okay.

03:56.730 --> 03:59.400
Heh, you sure talk big.

03:59.400 --> 04:00.860
You won't make it, though.

04:00.860 --> 04:04.240
Not to brag, but out of all
the hidden dungeons,

04:04.240 --> 04:07.370
mine has the highest difficulty.

04:07.870 --> 04:12.120
I think it'd be better for you to
just give up right away.

04:12.120 --> 04:14.120
Well, this'll be no problem.

04:14.600 --> 04:19.130
Hmph. Act cool while you can
because it won't last, human.

04:19.500 --> 04:25.010
I don't know you nor your intentions
with Big Sis Yuri, but...

04:25.010 --> 04:28.640
I'll reveal your true nature.

04:28.640 --> 04:32.930
Look at you, walking straight into
that pitfall there. What a simpleton.

04:32.930 --> 04:36.400
I'm gonna make you embarrass yourself
in front of my sister!

04:36.400 --> 04:39.150
Hey, kid, there's a pitfall ahead.

04:39.150 --> 04:39.940
Whoop.

04:42.150 --> 04:45.660
All right, kid. How about we
wrap this up fast and easy?

04:45.660 --> 04:46.490
Got it!

04:47.250 --> 04:48.530
Whoops!

04:48.530 --> 04:49.790
Yah!

04:49.790 --> 04:50.870
Missed!

04:51.450 --> 04:52.790
You fool!

04:52.790 --> 04:56.370
I put so much thought
into creating these traps!

04:56.370 --> 04:58.340
I mean, what can I do?

04:58.340 --> 05:00.380
Exactly! Who cares, anyway?

05:00.380 --> 05:02.550
Yuri's smile comes first!

05:03.400 --> 05:08.300
Pina has always been the type to enjoy
making things and entertain people with them.

05:09.300 --> 05:13.310
Do you really think these sorts
of things are meant to be entertaining?

05:13.310 --> 05:15.560
At worst, this could
cost someone's life...

05:15.560 --> 05:18.440
I'd never make such a dungeon,
just so you know!

05:18.440 --> 05:21.570
I send people out when things
get south, just so you know!

05:21.820 --> 05:24.740
By the way, some terribly strong
monsters are coming up.

05:24.740 --> 05:27.820
So, before you get totally
beaten down to a pulp,

05:27.820 --> 05:29.830
it's totally fine for you to give up!

05:29.830 --> 05:32.160
Nah. I ain't giving up.

05:32.700 --> 05:34.580
Enemy is up ahead, kid.

05:34.580 --> 05:36.160
It's an Alraune.

05:36.160 --> 05:40.590
An S-rank humanoid monster that
creates seeds of all kinds of plants.

05:45.970 --> 05:48.430
That's sleep pollen!

05:48.430 --> 05:51.510
How is it? Feeling sleepy yet?

05:53.060 --> 05:54.640
Not in the slightest, actually...

05:54.640 --> 05:59.150
I have All-Ailment Resilience,
so it doesn't affect me.

06:01.230 --> 06:03.110
Wh-Wh-What was that?!

06:03.110 --> 06:05.900
That's so unfair!

06:05.900 --> 06:08.740
Nothing I can do about that.

06:08.740 --> 06:12.410
I'm just doing what I can for Yuri.

06:12.410 --> 06:13.660
Ein...

06:14.160 --> 06:15.370
Steel Cutter.

06:16.580 --> 06:17.620
Super Accelerate!

06:21.710 --> 06:22.630
Appraise.

06:23.000 --> 06:24.070
(Universal Seeds (S+) Generates seeds
that grow all kinds of food and plants.)

06:24.080 --> 06:25.280
(Universal Garden (S+) Secretes nutrient-rich
sap that enables mass crop production.)

06:25.300 --> 06:27.050
That should do—

06:27.920 --> 06:30.800
Looks like something attacked
from the shadows.

06:30.800 --> 06:33.720
For real? I can't see them, though.

06:33.720 --> 06:36.850
Apparently, they're using Stealth.

06:36.850 --> 06:37.810
Is that so?

06:37.810 --> 06:40.980
Hey! How are you still
casually talking?!

06:40.980 --> 06:43.400
How come you're not
taking any damage?!

06:43.400 --> 06:47.190
You see, I have
Surprise Attack Nullification.

06:47.190 --> 06:49.240
Ughhh! That's cheating, dammit!

06:49.240 --> 06:54.120
By the way, normal attacks won't work
either, because I have Immovable Fortress.

06:54.120 --> 06:55.950
You're practically invincible!

06:58.370 --> 07:01.880
But, still. If my attacks won't work,

07:01.880 --> 07:05.590
as long as you're facing
my Silent Ants' Stealth,

07:05.590 --> 07:07.760
you won't be able to attack either!

07:07.760 --> 07:10.680
Kid, I've appraised their location.

07:10.680 --> 07:11.890
Roger, Ursula.

07:13.760 --> 07:14.760
Gravity Press!

07:20.390 --> 07:21.810
Then, Appraise.

07:22.120 --> 07:23.080
(Stealth (S+) Renders the body, scent, and
presence invisible with special membrane.)

07:23.080 --> 07:24.130
(Back Attack (S+) Super-enhances
leg strength for instant leaps behind enemies.)

07:26.320 --> 07:30.400
How are you defeating S-rank
monsters left and right so easily?!

07:30.400 --> 07:33.370
Having Yuri here is pretty much
a cheat, I guess.

07:33.370 --> 07:37.540
Waah! Dummy Big Sis!

07:37.540 --> 07:39.660
I'm sorry, Pina.

07:40.710 --> 07:42.790
However...

07:42.790 --> 07:46.250
I'm not the type to give up
over something like this!

07:46.250 --> 07:48.670
Your next enemies will be
so strong, you're gonna faint!

07:48.670 --> 07:51.800
Go get them, Arachne, Centaur!

07:54.050 --> 07:55.180
Super Accelerate!

08:02.560 --> 08:04.300
I've also appraised
their abilities for you, kid.

08:04.300 --> 08:05.780
(Steel Threads (S) Produces
threads as strong as steel.)
I've also appraised
their abilities for you, kid.

08:05.780 --> 08:07.220
(Sticky Threads (S)
Produces highly sticky threads.)
I've also appraised
their abilities for you, kid.

08:07.220 --> 08:07.230
(Magic Bow (S) Enhances arrows
with mana and controls their trajectory.)
I've also appraised
their abilities for you, kid.

08:07.230 --> 08:08.640
(Magic Bow (S) Enhances arrows
with mana and controls their trajectory.)
Neat. Thanks a bunch, Ursula.

08:08.640 --> 08:10.050
(Arrow Dodge (S)
Evades all arrow attacks.)
Neat. Thanks a bunch, Ursula.

08:10.050 --> 08:10.070
Neat. Thanks a bunch, Ursula.

08:10.820 --> 08:15.030
No way... Did he defeat two
S-rank monsters in an instant?

08:15.030 --> 08:19.450
What is happening?
Mister, are you a monster yourself?

08:19.450 --> 08:23.330
Huh? No. I'm just a normal Appraiser.

08:25.540 --> 08:29.050
There's nothing inherently
normal about you!

08:29.050 --> 08:32.840
Goddammit!

08:48.360 --> 08:49.820
Dammit...

08:49.820 --> 08:53.900
What do I do to deserve this?

08:54.900 --> 08:56.660
Thank you for everything.

08:57.910 --> 09:01.330
It's all his fault!

09:01.330 --> 09:04.160
That rubbish picker is to blame!

09:09.420 --> 09:11.250
Hey, isn't he...

09:11.250 --> 09:13.420
Yeah, that's Zoid.

09:13.420 --> 09:16.430
He's the bastard who used
his comrade as bait.

09:19.300 --> 09:20.600
Jolene?

09:22.220 --> 09:23.310
Zoid...

09:23.310 --> 09:26.060
What were you doing?
You suddenly disappeared on—

09:26.060 --> 09:27.940
Please don't speak to me so casually.

09:29.310 --> 09:31.360
Just how evil can you be?

09:31.360 --> 09:34.400
Did you actually Paralyze
Ein and use him as bait?

09:34.400 --> 09:36.530
It was Jolene who cast the spell!

09:37.590 --> 09:41.160
I didn't even want to do it!

09:41.160 --> 09:43.450
It's because Zoid forced me to!

09:46.460 --> 09:48.750
Hey! Cut that crap!

09:48.750 --> 09:49.830
You're the worst!

09:57.090 --> 09:58.970
Listen and remember this.

09:58.970 --> 10:02.720
No one is ever going to
party up with you again!

10:08.020 --> 10:10.690
Don't mess with me,
you piece of crap!

10:13.020 --> 10:15.240
Anyone else in that situation...

10:15.240 --> 10:17.610
...would've done the same thing I did.

10:17.610 --> 10:19.360
So why only me...

10:20.370 --> 10:25.370
If only that bastard Ein had just
quietly died, this wouldn't have happened.

10:26.580 --> 10:30.380
Now that it comes to this, I'll have to
solo my way through a high-difficulty quest.

10:30.380 --> 10:34.130
Gotta achieve some huge success
to wipe away my bad reputation.

10:35.710 --> 10:39.260
That's the only way to
regain the trust I've lost.

10:44.260 --> 10:47.390
A quest to hunt a C-rank monster.

10:47.390 --> 10:51.190
Normally it would be impossible
to do alone, but if it's me...

10:56.610 --> 10:58.280
That startled me...

11:00.410 --> 11:01.780
What is this place?

11:03.240 --> 11:04.530
A hidden dungeon?!

11:05.870 --> 11:07.540
Then this place must have them.

11:08.450 --> 11:10.960
Strong enemies, like those hellhounds.

11:11.750 --> 11:14.500
So what?

11:14.500 --> 11:18.260
I have to prove I'm capable,
or there's no future for me!

11:19.760 --> 11:21.680
Oh crap, am I...

11:22.180 --> 11:23.970
Am I going to die?

11:31.020 --> 11:33.520
Wait. Am I back from the start?

11:33.520 --> 11:35.770
Hey there, challenger!

11:36.570 --> 11:37.940
A voice came out of nowhere...

11:37.940 --> 11:40.860
You won't die in this dungeon.

11:40.860 --> 11:44.450
So feel free to challenge it anytime!
Buh-bye!

11:45.330 --> 11:46.870
Who's there?!

11:46.870 --> 11:50.210
Since I can't die in this dungeon,

11:51.160 --> 11:53.290
then I have nothing to fear.

11:54.170 --> 11:56.420
I'll just keep trying, again and again.

11:56.420 --> 11:58.670
No matter how many times it takes,

11:58.670 --> 12:01.590
I'll keep challenging this dungeon
until I clear it.

12:04.800 --> 12:07.560
But seriously, how huge is this place?

12:07.560 --> 12:09.810
It's just full of traps wherever I go.

12:15.230 --> 12:16.190
Violent Breaking Slash!

12:20.190 --> 12:24.410
D-Damn it! It hurts...
It hurts so much...

12:25.320 --> 12:28.200
If you're going to give up,
just say the word!

12:28.200 --> 12:32.080
It will trigger the mechanism
and automatically teleport you out.

12:32.080 --> 12:36.000
Who says I'm giving up?!

12:36.000 --> 12:39.340
I'll prove that I am strong!

12:56.060 --> 13:00.440
Even a high commoner like me couldn't
defeat that thing, yet he one-hit it?

13:00.440 --> 13:02.320
A-Amazing...

13:02.320 --> 13:04.950
Uh, thank you for saving me...

13:05.270 --> 13:08.700
Zoid? What are you doing here?

13:10.080 --> 13:13.580
Ein?! What are you doing here?!

13:13.580 --> 13:17.330
Why, you say? I'm here to
break through, of course.

13:17.680 --> 13:18.730
Appraise.

13:19.000 --> 13:20.070
(Weapon Destruction (S+) Destroys the
opponent's weapon on contact or during a clash.)

13:21.300 --> 13:24.920
No way. There's no way a rubbish picker
like you could one-hit anything.

13:24.920 --> 13:26.090
It's just impossible!

13:28.010 --> 13:32.100
Sorry to bother you, Yuri,
but could you help this guy out?

13:33.020 --> 13:35.020
Who is he talking to?

13:35.020 --> 13:35.850
Thank you.

13:43.480 --> 13:44.240
What?

13:44.860 --> 13:46.700
Later, Zoid.

13:46.700 --> 13:48.110
I'm in a hurry.

13:48.110 --> 13:49.120
Wait!

13:49.120 --> 13:49.870
Faint.

13:50.870 --> 13:53.870
Hey, Pina. This guy has given up.

13:53.870 --> 13:55.830
Get him out of here.

13:55.830 --> 13:58.330
What's the meaning of this?

14:02.670 --> 14:04.420
The Boss Monster's room?

14:04.420 --> 14:06.720
Exactly. You actually made it here!

14:06.720 --> 14:08.630
But unless you defeat the boss,

14:08.630 --> 14:11.890
you can't reach the princess's room.

14:11.890 --> 14:14.850
Wait a second.
If I defeat the Boss Monster,

14:14.850 --> 14:18.770
won't the door to Yggdrasil
be closed forever?

14:18.770 --> 14:22.520
Not unless you destroy
the dungeon core, no.

14:22.520 --> 14:24.480
All right, got it.

14:24.480 --> 14:26.780
Yuri, hold on a little longer.

14:26.780 --> 14:27.780
Okay.

14:33.790 --> 14:36.290
It's also a jungle inside, huh?

14:36.290 --> 14:38.790
Where is the enemy, Ursu—Whoa!

14:38.790 --> 14:39.710
Flight!

14:40.500 --> 14:42.920
The enemy is...

14:42.920 --> 14:46.090
Apparently the ground itself.

14:46.090 --> 14:46.960
What?

14:55.520 --> 14:57.230
Now, that's just way too big!

14:57.230 --> 14:59.520
This isn't the time to be whining, kid.

14:59.520 --> 15:01.400
Strike first!

15:01.400 --> 15:02.860
I know!

15:03.650 --> 15:05.400
Fireball!

15:11.910 --> 15:15.120
Whoa, whoa. Not even a scratch on him?

15:15.120 --> 15:16.410
This...

15:16.410 --> 15:20.080
I can feel a nostalgic wave of mana.

15:20.080 --> 15:21.250
What do you mean?

15:21.250 --> 15:23.130
We'll save it for later. It's coming!

15:29.260 --> 15:30.170
Super Appraise!

15:32.660 --> 15:33.890
Parry!

15:37.140 --> 15:38.140
Did that do it?

15:43.560 --> 15:45.190
It's still completely fine.

15:45.190 --> 15:48.400
How am I supposed to defeat
an enemy that takes no damage?!

15:50.700 --> 15:52.660
Fireball and Water Shot,

15:52.660 --> 15:55.410
I threw both of them at him...

15:56.580 --> 15:57.660
Could it be...

15:59.830 --> 16:02.330
What are you doing?!
You're about to be crushed!

16:11.340 --> 16:12.840
Just as I thought.

16:12.840 --> 16:15.760
Your physical attacks can't hit me.

16:15.760 --> 16:20.520
Why? Because that body of yours is just
a hollow shell created by an illusion!

16:20.520 --> 16:23.270
Show me your true form! Dispel!

16:28.150 --> 16:29.530
So tiny!

16:29.530 --> 16:34.160
It casts an illusion to
make the space appear larger.

16:34.160 --> 16:35.110
Indeed.

16:35.110 --> 16:39.160
It's a powerful illusion from a spirit
capable of creating even the space itself.

16:39.160 --> 16:42.290
That's why even I, the guardian,
couldn't see through it.

16:42.290 --> 16:46.330
This time, the credit
is yours to claim, kid. Well done.

16:46.330 --> 16:48.540
Wow, you do hand out praises.

16:49.590 --> 16:50.660
Appraise.

16:50.660 --> 16:51.760
(Genbu [Youngling] (S) The child of Genbu,
one of the Four Divine Beasts of Creation)

16:51.760 --> 16:54.970
(Genbu [Youngling] (S) The child of Genbu,
one of the Four Divine Beasts of Creation)
Hmm? Even the results were manipulated...

16:54.970 --> 16:55.640
(Genbu [Youngling] (S) The child of Genbu,
one of the Four Divine Beasts of Creation)

16:55.640 --> 16:56.920
(Genbu [Youngling] (S) The child of Genbu,
one of the Four Divine Beasts of Creation)
Wait, what?

16:56.930 --> 16:58.550
What is it, Ursula?!

16:58.550 --> 17:01.930
That turtle—No, that creature...

17:05.190 --> 17:08.940
H-Hey, Pina. Do I really have
to defeat this little fella?

17:08.940 --> 17:13.440
Of course! You can't clear the dungeon
without beating the boss!

17:13.440 --> 17:16.990
But I already broke through
your illusion, didn't I?

17:16.990 --> 17:19.330
My victory is practically guaranteed, no?

17:20.830 --> 17:25.080
I can't believe you're going to
let such a small, cute turtle die

17:27.330 --> 17:30.210
Aww, you poor little turtle.

17:30.210 --> 17:32.590
You'll be killed by Pina's pride.

17:32.590 --> 17:34.590
Ugh, fine!

17:34.590 --> 17:38.890
Yeah, okay!
This one is your victory! I give up!

17:47.100 --> 17:50.610
Hi, Sis! Long time no see!

17:52.860 --> 17:55.320
Pina!

17:55.320 --> 17:58.320
I missed you so much!

17:58.320 --> 17:59.490
I can't breathe!

18:00.240 --> 18:02.910
Oh, sorry! I got carried away.

18:02.910 --> 18:04.330
It's fine.

18:04.330 --> 18:08.830
So, is the person over there
the mean mister who bullied me?

18:09.500 --> 18:12.630
He's not mean!
He's really kind!

18:13.960 --> 18:17.380
Looks like you have a crush on him!

18:17.380 --> 18:19.220
What? Uh...

18:19.890 --> 18:24.890
Huh? Big Sis, your face is
as red as a tomato.

18:25.770 --> 18:29.020
Pina, you're as mischievous as ever.

18:29.940 --> 18:33.400
But I'm so glad you're still
as lively as ever.

18:33.400 --> 18:37.780
Geez, Big Sis, you're being so dramatic.

18:40.570 --> 18:44.040
All in all, they really are sisters after all.

18:44.040 --> 18:47.580
Hey, and by the way, I have a favor to ask.

18:49.870 --> 18:52.000
Can I go with you too?

18:52.000 --> 18:52.540
Huh?

18:52.540 --> 18:55.920
Come on. I've grown tired
of the underground.

18:55.920 --> 18:59.130
I'll give my spirit core to
the mister here if you let me.

18:59.130 --> 19:00.300
So, please? Can I?

19:00.300 --> 19:01.640
Sure!

19:01.640 --> 19:05.060
Um... Would you be okay with this, Ein?

19:05.060 --> 19:08.680
Of course! I'll respect your decision.

19:09.770 --> 19:10.810
Thank goodness.

19:10.810 --> 19:12.310
Yay!

19:20.990 --> 19:21.820
Whoa?

19:22.490 --> 19:24.490
I am Pina's guardian.

19:24.490 --> 19:27.450
My name is Kurohime,
the Divine Beast Genbu's daughter.

19:27.450 --> 19:28.500
Nice to meet you.

19:28.500 --> 19:30.750
That turtle from before
is the guardian!?

19:30.750 --> 19:32.960
Oh, Ursula, my dear.

19:32.960 --> 19:33.920
"My dear"?

19:33.920 --> 19:36.750
Lady Kurohime. I deeply apologize
for my earlier rudeness.

19:36.750 --> 19:40.970
Didn't I tell you to call me Kuro
instead of Lady Kurohime?

19:40.970 --> 19:42.260
I couldn't possibly!

19:42.260 --> 19:47.010
That Ursula is actually
using honorifics...

19:48.220 --> 19:49.810
What are ya looking at, kid?!

19:49.810 --> 19:52.270
Ask for permission
from Lady Kurohime first!

19:52.270 --> 19:52.770
Right...

19:55.190 --> 19:58.070
I believe you were listening, but...

19:58.070 --> 20:01.280
I'd like to get permission to take Pina
to the outside world.

20:01.280 --> 20:03.570
Of course, I approve.

20:03.570 --> 20:06.200
I also want that girl
to learn many things.

20:06.200 --> 20:07.030
If I may...

20:07.030 --> 20:10.040
I have one more favor to ask, Einy.

20:10.040 --> 20:11.460
Einy?

20:11.460 --> 20:13.540
May I accompany you as well?

20:15.580 --> 20:17.920
Is this a Sage's Stone?

20:17.920 --> 20:21.800
Yes. Just like Ursula and Yuri,

20:21.800 --> 20:25.760
this will allow Pina and I
to travel with all of you.

20:25.760 --> 20:26.800
Also...

20:27.970 --> 20:30.310
My ability is Barrier.

20:31.560 --> 20:34.560
I'm sure it will be of use to you, Einy.

20:34.560 --> 20:37.570
I see. That's reassuring.

20:37.570 --> 20:40.360
It's settled, then. Ursula, dear.

20:40.360 --> 20:44.660
Please turn Pina's Spirit Core
and my Sage's Stone into a prosthetic eye.

20:44.660 --> 20:45.740
Understood!

20:50.160 --> 20:53.710
The Spirit Core's processing is done, kid.

20:54.370 --> 20:56.080
- Wow, so this is Pina's...

20:56.080 --> 20:57.330
- Just shut your eyes.
- Wow, so this is Pina's...

20:57.330 --> 20:58.540
O-Okay.

21:03.650 --> 21:05.110
(Divine Spirit's Prosthetic
Eye (Level 4))

21:05.110 --> 21:05.470
(Grants Eye Technique and the ability to
appraise Illusion Techniques.)

21:05.470 --> 21:06.780
(Grants Eye Technique and the ability to
appraise Illusion Techniques.)
Wow! That's cute!

21:06.780 --> 21:06.800
Wow! That's cute!

21:07.390 --> 21:11.430
Still, with more people around,
it's getting livelier.

21:11.430 --> 21:12.180
Moreover...

21:13.020 --> 21:16.650
I'm glad that Yuri looks so happy.
More than anything.

21:17.190 --> 21:18.310
Hey, kid.

21:20.900 --> 21:22.190
Thank you.

21:25.530 --> 21:27.700
I'm merely doing what I should.

21:28.990 --> 21:31.120
Six more siblings left.

21:31.620 --> 21:33.410
And I'll find them all, I swear.

21:44.380 --> 21:47.220
Was I... saved?

21:50.600 --> 21:51.330
He was merely a low commoner.

21:51.330 --> 21:52.040
(Giant Rat Corpse (F)
A deceased Giant Rat.)
He was merely a low commoner.

21:52.060 --> 21:54.060
All he could do was pick up rubbish.

21:54.310 --> 21:56.310
That very same Ein...

22:09.620 --> 22:14.950
♪No matter what trials you face,
no reason to be in such a hurry♪

22:14.950 --> 22:19.960
♪The wind will never stop carrying on,
as long as you have faith in yourself♪

22:19.960 --> 22:22.380
♪Never give up, the future's just ahead♪

22:22.380 --> 22:25.460
♪Just like rock music that will never die♪

22:28.470 --> 22:30.430
♪Keep on, keep on strumming!♪

22:32.430 --> 22:37.180
♪There are only pointless things
I have to do on my list♪

22:37.180 --> 22:42.060
♪Even the sun of my burning heart
has now completely sank♪

22:42.060 --> 22:47.070
♪I have completely lost track
of my whereabouts♪

22:47.070 --> 22:51.870
♪I wonder where it goes
The very thing I once cherished♪

22:53.160 --> 22:55.620
♪I drowned in hustle and bustle♪

22:55.620 --> 22:57.080
♪In the midst of loneliness♪

22:57.080 --> 23:03.960
♪Every person is being
made aware of reality♪

23:05.840 --> 23:11.260
♪As I was reaching the out of reach
I wasn't sure if I saw a mirage♪

23:11.260 --> 23:15.930
♪As long as you have faith in yourself
The future is possible for you to change♪

23:15.930 --> 23:18.600
♪Even if rocks get in your way forward♪

23:18.600 --> 23:21.190
♪You must stick to your will
and see it through♪

23:21.190 --> 23:26.110
♪Even if, the worst, everything fails
There will definitely be another chance♪

23:26.110 --> 23:28.530
♪The only one to rival is yourself♪

23:28.530 --> 23:31.070
♪Always set your sights
on to rock 'n' goal!♪

23:31.070 --> 23:31.700
(Even Given)

23:31.700 --> 23:32.280
(the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,)

23:32.280 --> 23:32.490
(I'm)

23:32.490 --> 23:32.660
(Actually)

23:32.660 --> 23:32.780
(the Strongest)

23:35.870 --> 23:38.500
Next Episode:
Behemoth Subjugation Request.

23:38.500 --> 23:40.500
(Next Episode:
Behemoth Subjugation Request)
